OL,3,GNEWSAMan inspired to give back to NHS
OL,4,Aafter transplant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has become a patient transport
OL,7,Fworker to give back to the NHS, after
OL,8,Fundergoing a life-saving stem cell
OL,9,Ftransplant.
OL,11,FAshley Gray, from Hillsborough,
OL,12,FSheffield, was diagnosed with acute
OL,13,Fmyeloid leukaemia, a rare type of blood
OL,14,Fcancer, on New Year's Day 2023.
OL,16,FAfter his transplant in May that year,
OL,17,Fhe recovered well enough to return to
OL,18,Fwork and jumped at the opportunity to
OL,19,Fjoin the NHS.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
