OL,3,GNEWSAMan inspired to give back to NHS
OL,4,Aafter transplant
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I had so much gratitude and that's
OL,7,Fwhen I decided I wanted to do something
OL,8,Fmore worthwhile with my life," the
OL,9,F60-year-old said.
